{
  "info": {
    "name": "G5 · Taller A · Reseñas · SILEN Clothing",
    "description": "Tarjeta A · Reseñas de tu recurso (Prenda).\n\nRequisitos: API en marcha (npm run dev), migraciones aplicadas y `npx prisma db seed` (usuarios admin@silen.com / cliente@silen.com).\nEjecuta la carpeta completa con **Run collection**, en orden. Es re-ejecutable: crea su propia prenda y la elimina al final.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Taller · A · Isaac Maisincho",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Preparación · Login USER (cliente)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cliente@silen.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Cliente123*\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const token = pm.response.json().token;",
                  "pm.test(\"Devuelve un token JWT\", () => pm.expect(token).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userToken\", token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
